🔌 APIs you need
1. Authentication API
Handles registration, login and OTP.
POST /api/auth/register
POST /api/auth/login
POST /api/auth/verify-mobile-otp
POST /api/auth/verify-email-otp
POST /api/auth/forgot-password
GET  /api/auth/profile


2. Vehicle API 🚗
GET    /api/vehicles
POST   /api/vehicles
PUT    /api/vehicles/:id
DELETE /api/vehicles/:id
PUT    /api/vehicles/:id/primary
For example:
{
  "type": "car",
  "vehicleNumber": "MP04AB1234",
  "brand": "Tata",
  "model": "Nexon EV",
  "batteryCapacity": 40,
  "connector": "CCS2"
}


3. Charging Station API ⚡
GET /api/stations
GET /api/stations/:id
GET /api/stations/:id/chargers
GET /api/stations/nearby


4. Booking API 📅
POST   /api/bookings
GET    /api/bookings
GET    /api/bookings/:id
PUT    /api/bookings/:id/cancel
GET    /api/bookings/:id/qr
Booking data:
{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "stationId": 5,
  "chargerId": 12,
  "date": "2026-09-10",
  "timeSlot": "10:00-11:00"
}



5. AI Recommendation API 🤖
GET /api/recommendations/charging-time
It can consider:
Grid Load
Station Utilization
Transformer Utilization
Waiting Time
Tariff
Available Slots
Example response:
{
  "recommendedTime": "10:00 PM",
  "reason": "Lower grid demand and station utilization",
  "estimatedCost": 180,
  "gridLoad": "62%"
}




6. Charging Session API 🔋
POST /api/charging/start
GET  /api/charging/:sessionId
PUT  /api/charging/:sessionId/stop
GET  /api/charging/history
It can return:
{
  "battery": 78,
  "energyDelivered": 24.5,
  "power": 60,
  "duration": 32,
  "cost": 245
}


7. Grid Intelligence API 🌍
GET /api/grid/demand
GET /api/grid/forecast
GET /api/grid/transformers
GET /api/grid/stress
GET /api/grid/hotspots
POST /api/grid/optimize
POST /api/grid/what-if
{
  "zone": "Bengaluru",
  "currentLoad": 78,
  "transformerUtilization": 84,
  "risk": "MEDIUM"
}


8. Analytics API 📊
GET /api/analytics/overview
GET /api/analytics/peak-load
GET /api/analytics/station-utilization
GET /api/analytics/charging-cost
GET /api/analytics/forecast-accuracy

